normalizer quotations (16):
  !x:A m:num n. pwr (pwr x m) n = pwr x (m * n)
  !x:A y:A n:num. pwr (mul x y) n = mul (pwr x n) (pwr y n)
  !m n:num x:A. pwr x (m + n) :A = mul (pwr x m) (pwr x n)
  1
  2
  !x:A y. mul x y :A = mul y x
  !x:A y z. mul x (mul y z) = mul (mul x y) z
  !x:A y. add x y :A = add y x
